    "sections": {
        "description": "LocalMerchant is a modern, responsive WordPress theme designed for local businesses and merchants. The theme features a clean, professional design with customizable homepage sections including hero banners, services showcase, testimonials, and blog posts. Built with accessibility in mind, it offers full Customizer integration, widget areas, and a mobile-first responsive layout. Perfect for small businesses, local shops, service providers, and entrepreneurs looking to establish a strong online presence with an easy-to-customize, professional website."
